  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Islamabad-2014-Company Contracts</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project has three objectives over three engagements;

1. To increase the capacity of national and local humanitarian response agencies to effectively develop and deliver quality programming with coordinated, consistent and integrated accountability systems and standards.

2. Spot checks and monitoring of funds issued by DANIDA to the CSOs, and recommendations on the identified issues.

3. To identify, plan, implement, and monitor communication activities that increase the visibility of the Embassy&apos;s undertakings, raising awareness about Denmark&apos;s role in Pakistan, and promote Danish values.</narrative>
  </description>
